## Step 7: Verification of both arrangements

**Arrangement 1 (identity):** $a_n = n$ for all $n$. Then $\gcd(n,m) \mid n$ and $\gcd(n,m) \mid m$, so $\gcd(n,m) \mid n + m$. ✓

